    "text": "Wi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6re healf deadan adle & hwanon seo cume, seo adl cym\u00f0 on \u00fea swi\u00f0ran healfe \u00fe\u00e6s lichoman\n\u00dea w\u00e6tan man sc\u00e6l mid blodl\u00e6sum & drencum & l\u00e6cedomum on weg adon.\n\u00deonne seo adl cume \u00e6rest on \u00f0one mannan \u00feonne ontyne \u00feu his mu\u00f0, sceawa his tungan, \u00feonne bi\u00f0\nLacna hine \u00feonne \u00feus, gefere \u00fe\u00e6ne mannan on swi\u00f0e f\u00e6stne cleofan & wearmne, gereste him swi\u00f0e\nOnwreoh hine \u00feonne & sceawa his handa georne & swa hw\u00e6\u00feere swa \u00f0u cealde finde l\u00e6t him sona\n\u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6re blodl\u00e6se huhwega ymb III niht sele him wyrt drenc utyrnende, do gi\u00f0corna swa feala swa\nHwilum alwan \u00e6fter hire rihte him mon sc\u00e6l sellan, hwilum scamoniam, hwilum eft \u00e6fter\n\u00deonne he gerest sy l\u00e6t eft blod on \u00e6dre swa \u00feu on fruman dydest, hwilum \u00feu teoh mid gl\u00e6se o\u00f0\u00f0e mid\nWi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6re healfdeadan adle, be\u00fee hwilum \u00fea saran stowe \u00e6t heor\u00f0e o\u00f0\u00f0e be gledum & smere mid ele\nWyrc to sealfe ealdne rysle sealtne, heortes mearh, gose rysle o\u00f0\u00f0e h\u00e6nna & do gode wyrta, to be\u00f0e \u00fea\nHwilum onlege & onbind pic & weax, pipor & smeru & ele tog\u00e6dere gemilted.\nHwilum on \u00fea saran sinua & aswollenan lege on & bind on gate tyrdelu gemenged wi\u00f0 hunig o\u00f0\u00f0e on\n\u00deonne \u00fewina\u00f0 \u00fea aslapenan & \u00fea aswollena sina.\nWyrc him wyrt drenc \u00fee ne bi\u00f0 utyrnende ne spiwol ac todrif\u00f0 & lytla\u00f0 \u00fea yfelan w\u00e6tan on \u00feam\nGenim huniges \u00feis lytle pund, do \u00feonne to \u00fean gebeaten & asift pipor, syle \u00feonne to \u00feicganne \u00feam\nEft, ymbe \u00fereo niht syle him on \u00feam ilcan gemete o\u00f0\u00f0e mare & swa ymb feower niht.\nWi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re healf deadan adle do \u00feu hwilum sealtes cucler m\u00e6l to, menge wi\u00f0 hunig & eft pipor.\nCunna swa \u00e6g\u00feer ge on \u00feisum l\u00e6cedome ge on o\u00f0rum \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee ic eac write hu hit on niman wolde.\nGif \u00fe\u00e6t lic heard si utan lege on \u00feane l\u00e6cedom \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t heard for\u00f0i hwelige & \u00fe\u00e6t yfel ut teo.\nTeoh him blod of gif \u00fe\u00e6t neb o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t heafod sar si on \u00feam hnescan & nytta \u00feara l\u00e6cedoma \u00fee \u00feane\n& \u00feonne he \u00fea miht h\u00e6bbe gedo \u00fe\u00e6t he gelome gefnese.\nSyle him \u00fea mettas \u00fee syn ea\u00f0mylte & god seaw h\u00e6bben & he fram \u00feam mettum m\u00e6ge smaligan.\n\u00de\u00e6t syn gesodene wyrta, wyll, geote man \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6reste wos & \u00fe\u00e6t aftere onweg, do \u00feonne god wos to &\nHeald \u00feonne georne \u00fe\u00e6t se mete si gemylt \u00e6r he him eft gyfe for\u00f0an \u00fee se ungemylta mete him wyrc\u00f0\nScires wines drince \u00e6thw\u00e6ga, gif he ma wille drince hat w\u00e6ter.\nHealde hine georne wi\u00f0 b\u00e6\u00fe & hwilum \u00feonne he hit ge\u00ferowian m\u00e6ge l\u00e6te him blod on innan earme\n& hu seo healf deade adl \u00e6r feowertigum o\u00f0\u00f0e fiftigum wintra n\u00e6fre on men ne becume.\nSume bec l\u00e6ra\u00f0 wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re healfdeadan adle \u00fe\u00e6t man pintreow b\u00e6rne to gledum & \u00feonne \u00fea gleda\n& swa do \u00e6lce d\u00e6ge o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t se d\u00e6l \u00fe\u00e6s lichoman \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r adeadod w\u00e6s & gelewed to \u00fe\u00e6re \u00e6rran h\u00e6lo\nSo\u00f0lice seo adl cym\u00f0 on monnan \u00e6fter feowertigum o\u00f0\u00f0e fiftigum wintra.\nGif he bi\u00f0 cealdre gecyndo \u00feonne cym\u00f0 \u00e6fter feowertigum, elcor cym\u00f0 \u00e6fter fiftigum wintra his\nGif hit gingran men gelimpe \u00feonne bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t ea\u00f0l\u00e6cnere & ne bi\u00f0 seo ylce adl \u00feeah \u00fee ungleawe l\u00e6cas\nHu gelic adl on man becume on geogo\u00f0e on sumum lime swa swa seo healfdeade adl on